    "abstract": "Parts breakdown of the flight deck electronic flight bag mounting arm and power supply installation, with the fixed and ventilated arms shown as alternates and the switched supply module.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "Illustrated parts breakdown of the electronic flight bag mounting arm, control panel, power supply module and connector assembly on the flight deck side console.",
      "figure_note": "The figure is drawn looking inboard at the left hand side console; the right hand installation uses the same part numbers and is the mirror image. The alternates at item 10 are the fixed and the ventilated arm and their pivot base bolt patterns differ, so the console base must be checked before ordering. The switched power supply at item 30 is common to both sides. A mixed installation with a ventilated arm on the left and a fixed arm on the right is permitted and is common in service."
    },
